  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Worldwide Global Procurement Initiative Indonesia Orientation Visit, through Business Council for International Understanding</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This proposed Global Procurement Initiative: Indonesia Orientation Visit (OV) will sponsor up to 15 government officials and one U.S. Embassy representative to visit Washington, D.C. and two other U.S. cities for training on international best practices in value-based procurement. The OV supports the Government of Indonesia&apos;s ongoing efforts to establish a fair, transparent procurement system that utilizes international best practices.</narrative>
  </description>
